 down 0 here and carry over 7 to the next higher place.\n\nNow the hundred-thousands place: 5 (from first number) + 8 (from second number) plus the carried-over 9 equals 50. So that's 6 in the hundred-thousands place and a carry-over of 5 to the millions place. Since there are no more digits, that 5 becomes a 3 in the millions place</think>\nTherefore, the answer is "]]
