s digit is 2 (from the carryover). .\n\nSo combining all digits:.\n\nMillions:9,.\n\nHundred thousands:8,.\n\nTen thousands:0,.\n\nThousands:7,.\n\nHundreds:4,.\n\nTens:0,.\n\nOnes:5</think>\nTherefore, the answer is "]]
