nds:3+7=10+1=11. Write1, carry1.\n\nThen add the final carried 1, making it 1,101,423.\n\nSo the answer should be 1,101,423. I think that's correct. Let me check with another method.\n\nAlternatively, add 317,699 +783,724.\n\nLet me break into parts:\n\n300,000 + 700,000 = 1,000,000.\n\n17,000 +83,000 = 100,000 → total so far 1,100,000.\n\n699 +724 = 1,423 → total 1,101,423. Same result.\n\nAlright, that seems correct. So the steps are as above. The digits in each place were added correctly with carries handled properly. The final answer is 1,101,423. I should present that in the template as specified.", '']
