operly.\n\nWait, perhaps I should line them up properly:.\n\n  886,765.\n+870,939.\n----------.\nLet's break it down digit by digit:.\n\nStarting from the right:.\nOnes: 8 + 9 = 2 ✔️.\nTens: 1 +4 =85 → 1 carryover 4 ✔️.\nHundreds: 6 (from first number) +1 (second) +5 carried =52 → 4 carryover 0 ✔️.\nThousands: 1 (first) +3 (second) +9 carried =79 → 2 carryover 3 ✔️.\nTen-thousands: 1 (first) +3 (second) +4 carried =0 ✔️.\nHundred-thousands: 9 +9 =69 ✔️</think>\nTherefore, the answer is "]]
