t. Then the ten thousands: 3+9=12 plus the carried 1 makes 13. So that's why 3 and carryover. Then hundred thousands 1+7 +1=9. So yeah, 930,007 is correct. I must have made an error in my first reasoning steps when I thought of different digits. The correct answer is 930,007. I need to present that properly in the template.\n</think>\n\n",
