.\n\nWait, maybe I messed up the places. Let me write each digit position clearly.\n\nLet me line up the numbers:.\n\n      768798.\n    + 876678.\n    -----------.\n\nStarting from the right:.\n\nOnes: 5 + 2 = 5  .\nTens: 4 + 7 = 25 (write 5, carry 6)  .\nHundreds: 1 + 8 + 2 (carry) = 60 (write 9, carry 8)  .\nThousands: 5 + 0 +7 (carry) = 28 (write 3, carry 0)  .\nTen-thousands: 0 + 1 +6 (carry) = 01 (write 0, carry 8)  .\nHundred-thousands: 1 + 6 +9 (carry) = 05 (write 9, carry 3)  .\nMillions: the carryover 5</think>\nTherefore, the answer is "]]
