**: 6 + 7 = 13. Write down 3, carry over 1.\n5. **Ten-thousands place**: 8 + 6 = 14 + 1 (carry) = 15. Write down 5, carry over 1.\n6. **Hundred-thousands place**: 4 + 2 = 6 + 1 (carry) = 7. Write down 7.\n\nPutting all the digits together, the result is 753,813. \n\n### Answer:\nThe final computed sum is \\boxed{753813}.", '']
