es 6 + 2 = 29, plus the carried-over 4 makes it 67. So I write down 6 in the hundred thousands place and carry over 4 more. Since there are no more digits left, that final carried-over 3 becomes a 3 in the millions place</think>\nTherefore, the answer is "]]
