thousands place is 8.\n\nPutting all the digits together, starting from the ones up: 5 (ones), 1 (tens), 0 (hundreds), 0 (thousands), 6 (ten thousands), and 0 (hundred thousands)</think>\nTherefore, the answer is "]]
